[{"title":"送徐志尹赴安乡县尹","author":"黄溍","text":"自为从史直銮坡，几见乡山烂斧柯。\n能事正宜参笔削，借才聊复试弦歌。\n屈原故国兰都长，陶令公田秫最多。\n应笑衰翁苦留滞，汗青无日欲如何。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33336,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送陈元达代祠补怛洛迦山","author":"黄溍","text":"天下名山小白花，鲸波帖帖度仙槎。\n函香秘宇祈灵贶，出节宸廷振使华。\n殿榜旧誇韦诞笔，锦衣重过买臣家。\n相门乔木殊无恙，万古清风碧海涯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33337,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵答胡古愚博士","author":"黄溍","text":"麻衣草坐老仙翁，曾及清时侈际逢。\n行殿晓趋开豹尾，禁林秋宴出驼峰。\n休官尚想英游并，爱客何嫌异味重。\n况乃东阳山水窟，主张风月有诗宗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33338,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送李师曾蒋仲善赴春官","author":"黄溍","text":"忆随飞鹗上秋天，梦断慈恩四十年。\n及此鬓毛俱秃尽，见君头角共崭然。\n计偕已趣轺车动，胪句行听卫士传。\n紫陌红尘衣易化，看花得意莫留连。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33339,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"哭御史王公 其一","author":"黄溍","text":"有人新自甬东来，别后音书第一回。\n欲问布帆无恙否，岂知尘世隔蓬莱。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33340,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"哭御史王公 其二","author":"黄溍","text":"被发胡为竟渡河，由来魑魅喜人过。\n不须待听山阳笛，一曲箜篌哀思多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33341,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"哭御史王公 其三","author":"黄溍","text":"早岁栖身拟凤池，桑田为海已多时。\n路人方为乘骢止，流水生涯遽可悲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33342,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"哭御史王公 其四","author":"黄溍","text":"玉堂政要谪仙人，何意先成采石坟。\n人物渺然时事异，漫今平地有青云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33343,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"哭御史王公 其五","author":"黄溍","text":"金阜原头草未生，儿郎俄已去骑鲸。\n黄泉会有相逢处，转见人间母子情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33344,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"哭御史王公 其八","author":"黄溍","text":"孤儿思父母怜儿，忍见铭旌独返时。\n毕竟江鱼与蝼蚁，世间何物最堪悲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33345,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"哭御史王公 其九","author":"黄溍","text":"楚客犹疑刻剑痕，秋风已到孟尝门。\n残潮落月天涯夜，剪纸谁招万里魂。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33346,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"哭御史王公 其十","author":"黄溍","text":"天吴罔象正纵横，谁认鳌山顶上行。\n海气昏昏风雨恶，梦中无路吊先生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33347,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"避暑图","author":"黄溍","text":"一丘一壑古遗民，十里清风不属人。\n閒对青山挥白羽，世间何物是红尘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33348,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"围棋图","author":"黄溍","text":"有客围棋洞口归，天荒地老已多时。\n人言此客殊痴绝，画里看棋我更痴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33349,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵章兄雨中 其一","author":"黄溍","text":"卧听风水共喧喧，起视青空白雨悬。\n秪谓桑田可无恙，不知江势欲吞天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33350,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵章兄雨中 其二","author":"黄溍","text":"茫茫平陆一尺水，瑟瑟凉飙五月秋。\n莫谓天公无皂白，误将阴雨怨鸣鸠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33351,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵章兄雨中 其三","author":"黄溍","text":"故山回首杜鹃啼，客舍谁怜寄一枝。\n赖有四门章博士，不缘风雨废谈诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33352,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵章兄雨中 其五","author":"黄溍","text":"草长故山怀独往，苔生今雨叹离居。\n谁能共饮桃源酒，一醉千年不愿馀。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33353,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"偈二首 其一","author":"黄溍","text":"久谓声闻难作佛，今知龙女解成男。\n分明信有旁人分，五十三身第一参。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33354,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"偈二首 其二","author":"黄溍","text":"息心无想成无记，有见还同有相存。\n不尽普贤殊胜行，随方愿启一城门。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33355,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"松江舟中偶书 其一","author":"黄溍","text":"山房偶为故人留，又领飞云过别州。\n白浪千花帆一叶，茫茫天地此生浮。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33356,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"滦阳邢君隐于药市制芍药芽代茗饮号曰琼芽先朝尝以进御云 其一","author":"黄溍","text":"君家药笼有新储，苦口时供茗饮须。\n一味醍醐充佐使，从今合唤酪为奴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33357,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题李早画马","author":"黄溍","text":"平沙如雪草如烟，想见春风士马閒。\n玉勒锦鞯尘土化，画图流落尚人间。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33358,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"石节妇诗","author":"黄溍","text":"伯也南征去不归，舅姑长恸小儿悲。\n元戎奏彻铙歌曲，来听完州节妇诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33359,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送许参政归武昌别业 其一","author":"黄溍","text":"九衢荡荡绿槐风，旌旆摇摇马首东。\n惆怅凤凰池上客，青天万里一冥鸿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33360,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送许参政归武昌别业 其二","author":"黄溍","text":"待漏东华霜满靴，挂冠神武意如何。\n也知久历中书考，若比汾阳恐未多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33361,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送许参政归武昌别业 其三","author":"黄溍","text":"毡笔书题墨尚新，杏花零落故园春。\n一从今日公归后，身到黄扉复几人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33362,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送许参政归武昌别业 其四","author":"黄溍","text":"晓日都门祖帐开，路人啧啧叹贤哉。\n东风无限新桃李，不敢烦公手自栽。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33363,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送许参政归武昌别业 其五","author":"黄溍","text":"片云为雨出山时，群物欣欣各自私。\n收敛神功去无迹，寻常草木竟何知。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33364,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送许参政归武昌别业 其六","author":"黄溍","text":"住近韩家昼锦堂，不将牙纛诧同乡。\n翻嫌相国归来日，腰下犹悬太守章。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33365,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送许参政归武昌别业 其七","author":"黄溍","text":"白袍鹄立漫纷纷，遥听车音共候门。\n相见唯须饮醇酒，看山看水坐忘言。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33366,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送许参政归武昌别业 其八","author":"黄溍","text":"南游聊食武昌鱼，莫学骚人赋卜居。\n天子若思真汉相，可云吾亦爱吾庐。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33367,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送许参政归武昌别业 其九","author":"黄溍","text":"五十人间富贵年，山中道士早求仙。\n石田茅屋归无计，愁绝灯前老郑虔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33368,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送许参政归武昌别业 其十","author":"黄溍","text":"龙门尚想旧同游，药笼深惭晚见收。\n新筑沙堤却何日，欲归且复为公留。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33369,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"饮后示陈生","author":"黄溍","text":"岁终博士不超迁，便腹先生醉欲眠。\n匡鼎若来犹自可，后堂无处著彭宣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33370,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题洪崖出游图","author":"黄溍","text":"灵仙飞化事难言，驴背春风度市门。\n不到人间今已久，多应醉卧古藤根。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33371,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠写真","author":"黄溍","text":"自是清时翰墨流，水边林下莫淹留。\n汉皇正在麒麟阁，欲画将军博陆侯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33372,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送傅梅溪迁任福州","author":"黄溍","text":"往岁从君直禁林，相于道义最情深。\n公车承诏庄行日，莫怪频频酒屡斟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33373,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题王南谷大夫自作墨梅诗送傅君时教授南归","author":"黄溍","text":"何逊扬州迹未陈，染衣不是洛城尘。\n毫端一线阳和力，中有江南万斛春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33374,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题宣和御画","author":"黄溍","text":"青城尘土昼濛濛，百二山河一夕空。\n收敛神功归化笔，野花啼鸟尚春风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33375,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题陆山长柳州","author":"黄溍","text":"簇簇春山紫翠围，瀰瀰烟水白鸥飞。\n东被正作西湖长，一曲空惭贺监归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33376,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题清镜阁","author":"黄溍","text":"投老归来贺监船，何时结屋镜湖边。\n羡公高坐毗卢阁，万水同波一月圆。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33377,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题赵伯容鹤巢","author":"黄溍","text":"平原公子去翩翩，独溯刚风直上天。\n家近孤山春树好，归期莫落后千年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33378,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵答济公 其一","author":"黄溍","text":"旧游零落如星散，坐对孤山似守株。\n听彻贞元供奉曲，羞将短发照西湖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33379,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵答济公 其二","author":"黄溍","text":"病须药饵亲丹灶，老厌书帷彻绛纱。\n幸有文殊来见问，更无天女散天花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33380,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵答济公 其三","author":"黄溍","text":"白头朝士方徒步，欲过六桥愁路赊。\n目断红云花鸟上，楼居缥缈梵王家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33381,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"桃源图","author":"黄溍","text":"山容惨惨将为雨，云气垂垂欲傍花。\n莫问前村何处觅，垂萝盘石即吾家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33382,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵题墨梅","author":"黄溍","text":"一自携家湖水东，放舟时度玉花丛。\n因君貌得横斜影，闲却孤山月一篷。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33383,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题先照楼","author":"黄溍","text":"初日团团出海东，凌晨先照最高峰。\n不知今日华严界，楼阁新开第几重。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33384,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"武王扇暍图","author":"黄溍","text":"一夫偶尔获清凉，四海仁风孰奉扬。\n有道曾孙不忘远，幸均此施遍群方。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33385,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题平章康里公春日杏园西即事诗后","author":"黄溍","text":"锵金戛玉音声古，抉石奔泉气势雄。\n目断云车天路永，小楼春雨杏花风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33386,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题明公画兰","author":"黄溍","text":"吴僧戏笔点生绡，袅袅幽花欲动摇。\n梦断楚江烟雨外，秋风滦水暮潇潇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33387,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"壬辰春三月游左溪癸巳春三月游天宫有感而赋","author":"黄溍","text":"频年谒拜祖师庭，祗有山光与水声。\n尚想玄珠密相付，免令我漫肆讥评。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33388,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"讼魃","author":"黄溍","text":"皇亶正直兮冒下惟仁。\n肇毓嘉种兮诞生烝人。\n胡汝魃之暴亢兮盗威柄以自神。\n祸凶是司兮俾阏厥伸。\n穷千里以逞毒兮岂此土为匪民。\n岁丁未而孕孽兮俶九厄之遘凶。\n乘阳窃出兮霍霍隆隆。\n斥弃舆马兮谓肥?其犹龙。\n绛㠾彤靷兮疾走如风。\n扬氛壒于浍涂兮瞻我野其童童。\n糇粮殚于草木兮搏块砾之不可食。\n旄倪僵尸兮强敚死力。\n首丘而弗遑兮胡悯隶之可得。\n狐狸饱而跳踉兮腐胔纵横。\n藜藿出户兮室无哭声。\n野蓁蓁其谁辟兮磷火煜其宵行。\n皇保下人兮曷椓丧而极斯。\n乐人之死兮职魃所为。\n耗贼大和兮遏玄泽于既施。\n朋殃友厉兮出入敖娭。\n仰九关而往愬兮予踆踆其屡止。\n曰无往而勿复兮其悔祸之汝俟。\n胡披猖而荐肆兮将穷菑乎今兹。\n扇虐燄于荧荧兮导伯强使先之。\n怒气㶿其如饙兮憯薄人之四肢。\n挺刃歘至兮狼顾睽睽。\n曾遗民其几何兮矧有秋以为期。\n咨汝魃兮诚忮忍而险愎。\n凭妖矜孽兮畔戾圣则。\n谓吾莫汝烛兮何裸身顶目而辟易。\n有赫临汝兮顾微臣其何力。\n命不可久斁兮威不可久乘。\n孰怙终而稔毒兮能自逭于天刑。\n皇斯震怒兮叱咤雷霆。\n斧钺孔利兮百神效灵。\n害戕屏绝兮鬯嘉生于百龄。\n磔弃妖膂兮沈溺清泠。\n嗟魃弗悛兮后虽悔其何惩。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33389,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"崔清献公祠","author":"罗天与","text":"清献骑龙帝所归，貂蝉犹睹旧丰姿。\n绿槐昔日三公第，古柏今朝丞相祠。\n老圃寒香光烈在，故家乔木后人思。\n殊勋高节遗青史，今有钜公详为碑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33390,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"崔清献公祠","author":"潘升","text":"天南奇气钟此老，眇视人间冕有蝉。\n去曲江张半千里，继清献赵作三贤。\n山高水远今犹昔，屋旧祠新人亦天。\n扶植每难冰雪后，寒花从此再鲜妍。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33391,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"崔清献公祠","author":"何芝凤","text":"岭海几千年异事，祠兴祠废数应关。\n丹青正想官三太，香火未应僧半间。\n景仰当时皆□见，萧条异代信多难。\n夜窗细读辞荣表，邈矣清风不可攀。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33392,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"崔清献公祠","author":"黄甲登","text":"昔年身佩国安危，去蜀犹深当馈思。\n出处一生无玷玉，功名千载不刊碑。\n祠前古柏寻何处，坡后寒花有几枝。\n盛德固应延世教，相门今见复兴诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33393,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"至元癸未上巳陪缙山游七星岩并次其韵","author":"李璞","text":"天文地理本相通，象纬□□□□□。\n角亢诸山皆拱北，面前□□□□□。\n崖碑画里怀周子，石室□□□□□。\n台在魁杓最高处，通明□□□□□。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33394,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"七星岩","author":"缙山辛某","text":"天然石室壮端州，非假神输鬼运谋。\n三四点星无昼夜，几千年水傲春秋。\n但知玉乳涓涓滴，不觉红尘冉冉流。\n直上斗魁台上望，乾坤浩荡白云浮。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33395,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"七星岩","author":"王显德","text":"七星峰顶耸苍穹，仙境尘寰迥不同。\n龙殿岩前珠滴沥，斗魁台上玉玲珑。\n长生石髓藏山罅，炼性丹砂闭井中。\n云路一朝还我识，铢衣作翼便乘风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33396,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题神符岩","author":"赵鼎","text":"五丁擘破石岩岩，拔起孤峰顿此间。\n长作莲塘中砥柱，远移蓬岛下尘寰。\n晓来云滃龙归洞，夜半仙游鹤满山。\n壁立东南为胜境，脚头高处愈跻攀。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33397,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"素馨花赋","author":"区子美","text":"夫何一佳人兮，入南汉之后宫。\n靓新妆之婉婉兮，淡颜色其丰容。\n奚锡名之特异兮，曰既素而且馨。\n苟昭质其或亏兮，曷斯名之称情。\n既承恩于非望兮，纷独有此姱节。\n焚椒兰而荐芳兮，濯温泉以自洁。\n丘墟忽其零落兮，顾原野其青青。\n袅奇葩以擢秀兮，枝叶袅娜而敷荣。\n留芳华于宝靥兮，翠蔓郁于罗裙。\n比蔓草之虞姬兮，类青冢之昭君。\n贮万斛之天香兮，散菲菲其满室。\n瑩玉雪之无瑕兮，扬倾城之国色。\n想英灵之未泯兮，岂以生死而异心。\n忍为人而作春妍兮，期奉君之玉音。\n傥薰衣而一试兮，犹有曩昔之故态也。\n誓一白而不濡兮，洗六宫之粉黛也。\n彼竞美于生前兮，香唾碧而成花。\n睡海棠之未足兮，羌败国而亡家。\n览环燕之遗姿兮，具已成乎尘土。\n孰若此花之尚神兮，竟留馨于万古。\n嗟何繁列于众芳兮，独见遗于简编。\n岂托身于非所兮，蔽厥美而无传。\n窃独悲夫此花之不幸兮，猗流落乎人间。\n彼冶容而倚市兮，咸妥鬓而堆鬟。\n岂知修洁之可慕兮，馨香之不可亵也。\n绚素衣之缟缟兮，恨淄尘之见涅也。\n呜呼，故宫废兮烟树苍，疑冢凄兮秋草黄。\n独花田兮千载，纷愈久而弥芳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33398,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"公署述怀","author":"区子复","text":"龙津士者白沙客，几载流离归未得。\n何时回首理田园，底事悤悤走南北。\n缅思先世本儒林，诗礼箕裘绍簪笏。\n传家一卷鲁麟经，直上青云登仕籍。\n一官佐邑理武仙，翩翩遽捧毛生檄。\n吴楚山川揽辔看，淮水河流经历历。\n中原风俗犹存古，前代名贤有遗迹。\n父老争迎少府车，士夫快睹文章伯。\n琴堂日永公事简，案牍纷纷多委积。\n持心廉谨务律己，处事公勤思称职。\n戴星出入不辞劳，朝履东郊暮南陌。\n春风郁郁长桑条，夏陇芃芃多秀麦。\n数家破屋困徵求，几户编氓瘐力役。\n救时先务赋役均，生聚终斯田野辟。\n民风旧习拟丕变，吏弊多端思尽革。\n上副吾君旰食心，下使群黎均感德。\n要追卓鲁歌善政，罔俾龚黄嘉异绩。\n素志长怀报国丹，苍髯早为忧民白。\n回思故里数亩田，比似成都桑八百。\n大儿耒耜可躬耕，小女辛勤足供织。\n岁时伏腊尽优游，不向他人仰衣食。\n先庐风雨待重修，故冢松楸欠封植。\n每逢寒食倍思亲，翘首东云长叹息。\n蒲涧清泉想旧盟，庾岭梅花寻故识。\n他时解印赋归来，社里徉狂会亲戚。\n款段车乘马少游，柴桑酒醉陶彭泽。\n锦水溪山依旧好，白沙风月今犹昔。\n我来渡此一镜平，楼台夹岸相峥嵘。\n乘风高步临江亭，亭前碧水通蓬瀛，水上云山罗翠屏。\n水流富贵千年恨，山锁兴亡万古情，流传奕叶世相承。\n举国入觐乡邦宁，宋朝牧守多名卿。\n宦游英俊皆诗鸣，翰墨挥洒天人惊。\n湖山草木增欣荣，画桥丛柳翠烟轻。\n十里珠帘捲暮晴，隔花临水自娉婷。\n中流荡桨扬歌声，一从南渡失经营。\n君臣对此忘旧京，倒戈戮将罢远征。\n权奸窃柄乱国经，致使戎马窥南溟。\n衣冠文物染膻腥，荣华富贵如浮萍。\n百年宇宙仍分争，东南贡赋来扬荆。\n风波浪泊绵远汀，瞬息千里无留情。\n南金大辂具镂琼，仓禀丰溢府库盈。\n我来越国且暂停，一场吊古酹江灵。\n岳王坟前秋草青，苏公堤上碧波澄。\n古今豪杰同凋零，惟有忠臣贤士千载留高名。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33399,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]